msgid ""
"The difference between **present perfect** and **past simple** is one of "
"the most searched English grammar questions — and one of the easiest to "
"hear in speech. Learners often know the forms on a quiz, then mix them up "
"the moment they start talking."
msgstr ""
"A diferença entre **present perfect** (presente perfeito) e **past simple** "
